{
  "name": "shearing-milking",
  "normalizations": [
    "Compare shearing a red sheep (once; a sheared sheep gives nothing more) with the shears' wear; the wool drops one item per wool, one to three at random, so it is not compared, milking a cow and a goat with buckets (a calf gives nothing), stew from a mooshroom with a bowl, and milking in creative, which keeps the bucket and adds one milk bucket. Creative stew from a mooshroom keeps the bowl and adds a stew each time.",
    "Use matching flat terrain."
  ],
